        "overlayOf": null,
        "transparent": false,
        "axes": null,
        "spec": {
          "sourcePage": 55,
          "sourceRegion": "Question 15, triangle below parts a–c",
          "description": "Triangle ABC with A left, B above-right and C below-right. Rotated side labels lie below AB and outside BC. Dashed upward reference rays at A and B have arrowheads but no N labels. Preserve the source bearing labels without adding arcs or a right-angle square.",
          "mathematics": "AB = 70 km; BC = 90 km; bearing A to B = 056°T; bearing B to C = 146°T. AC is unlabelled. All point labels remain.",
